<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ejisu</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ejisu is a town in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashanti-empire">Ashanti</a> region of present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ghana">Ghana</a>. Its queen mother, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yaa-asantewaa">Yaa Asantewaa</a>, led the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/war-of-the-golden-stool">War of the Golden Stool</a> against the British in 1900, the last major armed resistance of the Ashanti Empire against colonial rule.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ejisu.jpg" alt="Ejisu" width="320" height="180" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Joy Agyepong · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ejisu_Bebease_Shrine_4.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
